# CR 303.4h/601.2c: an Aura with "Enchant player" targets a player as it is
# cast (castPlayerAura, castspell.go). Both players are legal, so human is asked
# through ChooseTargets and picks ai. On resolution the Curse enters and attaches
# to ai (attachEffect -> AttachToPlayer): EnchantingPlayer, Java's own spelling.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
tapformana human 6 R
queue targets ai
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
